      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><header class=\"ds-card-h\"><b>#SD-1042</b><span class=\"ds-card-ch\">Email</span><span class=\"ds-stamp\"><span>Due 2h</span></span></header><h3>Refund still not in my account</h3><p>I returned the headphones on 2 Nov and the refund has not arrived.</p><footer><span class=\"ds-badge\">Open</span><span class=\"ds-pri\"><i></i>Urgent</span><span class=\"ds-card-d\">Nov 9</span></footer></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{font-family:'Schibsted Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:360px;background:#FFFAF3;border:1px solid #E4D3BF;border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px 12px;cursor:pointer}.ds-card:hover,.ds-card:active{background:#F8EFE3}.ds-card:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #4A3290;outline-offset:2px}.ds-card-h{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;border-bottom:1px solid #9B7ED6;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:13px;line-height:16px;color:#1F1A2B}.ds-card-ch{flex:1;margin-left:12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#5F566B}.ds-card h3{margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.1px;color:#1F1A2B}.ds-card p{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;color:#5F566B}.ds-card footer{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600}.ds-badge{background:#E8DFF7;color:#4A3290;border-radius:6px;padding:2px 7px}.ds-pri{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;color:#9C2A1C}.ds-pri i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;background:#B3261E;transform:rotate(45deg)}.ds-card-d{margin-left:auto;font-weight:400;font-size:13px;color:#766C80}.ds-stamp{--ink:#4A3290;display:inline-block;border:1.5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:3px;padding:1.5px;transform:rotate(-2.5deg)}.ds-stamp>span{display:block;border:0.75px solid var(--ink);border-radius:1.5px;padding:1px 5px;color:var(--ink);font-size:11px;line-height:14px;font-weight:600}"
